Z||000005||Kevin-84SE||01-24-2001||08:10 PM||||They are connected to the stereo output and show varying volume level. There are 10 LED's in a bar graph for each side. As the sound changes the number of LED's that light up change (no LED's when silence and 10 LED's when loud) The switch changes from bar mode to dot mode. Basically just lights to go with the music, many high end VCR's used to have these, some stereo systems still have them but they are usually not LED's anymore. <BR>I didn't want ashtrays in my car so I made these to put in their place.<BR>I made my first one back in 1981 and put it in the front of the ashtray of my 69 Impala. I made this one for the Fiero in 1984 and it is the last one I made.<P>   Kevin ||||reg||6
